# Custom hooks (`src/hooks`)

## Do

- Prefix custom hooks with **`use`**.
- Keep **TanStack Query** orchestration under **`src/hooks/query/**`** when adding server-backed features; colocate **`*.keys.ts`** factories next to domain hooks.
- Delegate HTTP to **`src/services/**`** and the shared Axios instance **`src/libs/axios/instance.ts`** (export **`api`**).

## Editor-specific note

- Most interactive editor logic lives in **`src/features/editor/stores/**`** and **`src/features/editor/core/commands/**`**, not in `src/hooks`. Add hooks here when introducing **new API/Query** surfaces; don’t duplicate editor state that already belongs in `docStore` / tool stores.

## Don't

- Don’t violate **Rules of Hooks** (conditional hooks, hooks in loops).
- Don’t duplicate the same **`useQuery`/`useMutation`** options everywhere — wrap in a dedicated hook.

## Security

- Follow **`000-core.mdc`**. Hooks that handle auth must not return secrets to unrelated UI.
